{"id":"n73353-10-9","stage":0,"title":"내리다 · 卸下","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73353-10-9-1","ko":"아저씨, 이삿짐들을 이 문 앞에 내려 주세요.","zh":"师傅，请把搬家的行李卸在这扇门前。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아저씨,","meaning":"师傅","explanation":"아저씨：对成年男性的称呼；这里称呼搬家师傅。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}},{"text":"이삿짐들을","meaning":"搬家的行李","explanation":"이삿짐：搬家时运送的行李；-들 表复数，-을 标记宾语。","readings":[{"term":"이삿짐","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71996","senseId":"1","lemma":"이삿짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이삿짐들을","audio":"/audio/df8d54b245ea927f8135.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"문","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"门前","explanation":"앞：前面；-에 表示放置行李的地点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"내려","meaning":"卸下来","explanation":"내리다：从上方卸下；-어 连接后面的 주다，构成请求。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"10","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려","audio":"/audio/9dfd423f6a64e3137818.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"请帮我……","explanation":"-어 주다 表示为对方做；-세요 是礼貌请求句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"师傅、大叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"对成年男性的称呼；这里是对搬家工作人员的称呼。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"2ad758f1225008c2","term":"이삿짐","zh":"搬家的行李","audio":"/audio/2ad758f1225008c20bed.mp3","entryId":"71996","definition":"搬家时需要搬运的行李物品。","pronunciation":["이사찜","이삳찜"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"卸下，放下","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"将上面的东西放到下面来。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea04e0f91d1ae9336a59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73353-10-9-2","ko":"네. 그럼 여기에 짐들을 놔두겠습니다.","zh":"好的，那我就把行李放在这里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"好的","explanation":"네：对请求作肯定回应。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"放在这里","explanation":"여기：这里；-에 表示放置的地点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"짐들을","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐들을","audio":"/audio/3d10da30f2d083fcc5ac.mp3"}},{"text":"놔두겠습니다.","meaning":"我会放着","explanation":"놔두다：放下并留在那里；-겠- 表示说话人的意愿，-습니다 是正式礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"놔두다","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28326","senseId":"1","lemma":"놔두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놔두겠습니다","audio":"/audio/df95d064105b7d37a7f7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"好的","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"对请求作肯定回应。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronu